  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## Changes since 0.3.0\n\n### Additions\n* Added xml doc comments to ``ArgumentsBuilder``, ``CredentialsBuilder``, and ``EnvironmentVariablesBuilder``  builder classes\n* Added xml doc comments to ``CommandResultValidation``, ``CommandResult``, ``CommandPiping``, and ``BufferedCommandResult`` classes.\n* Added .NET 9 TFM to CliRunner\n* Added .NET Standard 2.0 support to CliRunner.Specializations library\n\n\n### General Changes\n* Renamed Command class' ``RequiresAdministrator`` method to ``RunAsAdministrator``\n* Renamed Command class' ``RunAsAdministrator`` property to ``RequiresAdministrator``\n* Implement IDisposable in ``CredentialsBuilder``\n* Enhanced ``CommandNotSuccessfulException`` exception information.\n* Removed code that prevented an Exception being thrown when ``UseShellExecute`` was set to true and ``StandardInput`` was not set to Null - This is intended behaviour by .NET and the workaround is being removed\n\n\n### Removals\n* Removed ``UrlRunner`` and ``IUrlRunner`` - URL Opening code is being moved to a separate library that'll be published later.\n\n\n### Bug FIxes\n* Fixed an issue where the wrong localization string was used when throwing an exception\n* Fixed an issue where argument escaping was ignored in a builder method with the ``escape`` bool paramter.",
